\p
\v 44 Those¦61587 were¦61588 the¦61588 ones that Mosheh¦61591 and¦61592 Aharon¦61592 and¦61593 the¦61593 twelve Israeli¦61594 leaders¦61593 (one¦61600 from each tribe) listed.
