\v 52 \add When\add* the¦61720 \add other\add* \add ≈Israelis¦61721\add* set up camp¦61725, each man must set up with his army division¦61730 by their¦61730 banner,
\v 53 \add ≈but¦61732\add* the¦61732 Levites¦61732 will¦61733 camp¦61733 there around¦61734 the¦61735 \add ≈sacred¦61735 tent¦61735\add* and \add ≈look after\add* it¦61739. \add ≈That way,\add* the¦61744 Israeli¦61745 community¦61743 won't¦61737 make \add Yahweh\add* \add ≈angry¦61740\add*.
\v 54 \add ≈So¦61754 the¦61755 Israelis¦61755 did¦61754 everything\add* that¦61758 Yahweh¦61760 had¦61759 instructed¦61759 Mosheh¦61763.
\c 2
