\p
\v 3 On¦61796 the eastern¦61797 side facing the sunrise will¦61798 be¦61798 Yehudah's¦61800 \add !(Judah's¦61800)\add* banner and their¦61801 army divisions¦61801, led by Amminadav's¦61808 son¦61806 Nahshon¦61805
\v 4 with 74,600 in his¦61810 division¦61810.
