\p
\v 5 Then¦62248 Yahweh¦62249 told¦62248 Mosheh¦62252,
\v 6 “Summon the¦62258 Levites to come¦62255 and¦62260 stand¦62260 in¦62262 front¦62262 of¦62262 Aharon¦62263 the¦62264 priest¦62264, so¦62265 they¦62265 can assist¦62265 him¦62266.
\v 7 They¦62268 must¦62268 perform duties¦62271 for him and¦62272 for the¦62274 entire¦62275 community¦62277 at and around¦62281 the \add ≈sacred¦62285 tent¦62285\add*,
\v 8 including¦62287 \add ≈looking after\add* all¦62290 of¦62290 its equipment¦62292 and¦62295 \add ≈fulfilling the¦62297 obligations¦62297\add* of¦62297 the¦62298 \add ≈Israelis¦62299\add*.
\v 9 You¦62306 must¦62306 assign the¦62309 Levites¦62309 to¦62310 Aharon¦62310—out of¦62311 all the¦62317 \add ≈Israelis¦62318\add* it's¦62315 them who are assigned \add to serve the priests\add*.
\v 10 Appoint¦62326 Aharon¦62322 and¦62323 his¦62325 sons¦62325 as priests¦62330 and¦62331 to preserve the priesthood¦62330. Any other person \add ≈who tries to act as a priest\add* \add ≈must¦62333 be¦62333 executed¦62333\add*.”
\p
\v 11 Then¦62336 Yahweh¦62337 told¦62336 Mosheh¦62340,
\v 12 “Out of¦62352 all the \add ≈Israelis¦62359\add*, I've¦62345 taken¦62345 the¦62348 Levites¦62348 instead of¦62349 the¦62350 \add ≈oldest son from every¦62353 family\add*. The¦62356 Levites \add ≈will be the¦62358 ransom for those sons¦62358\add*, and¦62360 so they¦62360 belong to¦62361 me¦62361,
\v 13 because¦62364 every firstborn male person¦62382 and animal¦62385 is set¦62376 aside as belonging¦62387 to¦62377 me¦62377 ever since I killed¦62370 those firstborn¦62380 males in¦62381 Egypt¦62375. I¦62388 am¦62389 Yahweh¦62389.”
\s1 The census of the Levites
\rem /s1 A Census of the Levites; The Census of the Levites
\p
\v 14 ⇔Then¦62392 in the Sinai¦62398 wilderness¦62397, Yahweh¦62393 told¦62392 Mosheh¦62396,
\v 15 “List all the male¦62411 Levites that are at least one month¦62414 old. Count¦62416 them¦62416 by their families and clans¦62408.”
\v 16 \add ≈So¦62418\add* Mosheh¦62420 listed¦62418 them¦62419 exactly as Yahweh¦62424 had¦62426 commanded¦62426 him to,
\v 17 and¦62428 these¦62430 were Levi's¦62433 sons¦62431: Gershon¦62435, Kohat¦62436, and¦62437 Merari¦62437.
\v 18 Gershon's¦62443 sons¦62441 were: Livni¦62445 and¦62446 Shimei¦62446.
\v 19 Kohat's¦62449 sons¦62448 were¦62451: Amaran, Yitshar¦62452, Hevron¦62453, and¦62454 Uzziyel¦62454.
\v 20 Merari's¦62457 sons¦62456 were¦62459 Mahli¦62459 and¦62460 Mushi¦62460.
\m Those¦62461 were¦62463 the¦62463 families¦62463 of¦62463 the¦62464 Levites¦62464 by their¦62466 clans.
\p
\v 21 Gershon's¦62468 descendants were the Livnites and¦62471 the¦62472 Shimites¦62472, so they¦62474 made up the Gershonites.
\v 22 They had 7,500 males¦62482 that were at least a¦62485 month¦62485 old.
\v 23 The¦62493 Gershonite clans¦62493 were to camp¦62497 on the western¦62498 side of the \add ≈sacred¦62496 tent¦62496\add*,
\v 24 and¦62500 \add *their\add* leader¦62500 was¦62505 Lael's¦62508 son¦62506 Elyasaf¦62505.
\v 25 Gershon's¦62513 descendants¦62511 were¦62516 responsible¦62510 for the¦62516 \add ≈sacred¦62516 tent¦62516\add*, including¦62517 its¦62518 covering¦62518 and¦62519 the¦62520 entrance¦62520 curtain,
\v 26 the¦62524 courtyard curtains¦62524, and the courtyard entrance¦62529 curtain, that¦62531 surrounded¦62538 \add *it\add*. Also¦62535 the¦62537 ropes¦62540 \add ≈used to¦62541 hold them\add*.
\p
\v 27 Kohat's¦62544 descendants were the¦62546 Amramites¦62546, the Yitsharites, the Hevronites, and the¦62552 Uzziyelites¦62552, so they¦62554 made up the Kohatites.
\v 28 They had 8,600 males¦62561 that were at least a¦62564 month¦62564 old. They were¦62566 \add ≈in charge of\add* the running of the \add ≈sacred¦62572 tent\add*.
\v 29 The¦62574 Kohatite clans¦62574 were to camp¦62578 of the southern¦62582 side¦62580 of¦62580 the¦62581 \add ≈sacred¦62581 tent¦62581\add*,
\v 30 and¦62584 \add *their\add* leader¦62584 was¦62590 Uzziyel's¦62594 son¦62592 Elitsafan¦62590.
\v 31 They were \add ≈in charge of¦62596\add* the¦62597 box¦62597, the¦62598 table¦62598 and¦62599 the¦62599 lampstand¦62599, the¦62600 altars¦62600 and¦62601 all¦62607 the utensils used for ministry¦62608, the \add inside\add* curtain and its¦62608 gear.
\p
\v 32 The man who organised the Levites was Aharon's¦62616 son¦62614, Eleazar¦62613 the¦62617 priest¦62617. He had oversight¦62618 over all those who were responsible¦62620 for the¦62621 \add ≈sacred¦62621 tent\add*.
\p
\v 33 Merari's¦62623 descendants were the¦62625 Mahlites¦62625 and¦62626 the Mushites, so they¦62629 made up the Merarites.
\v 34 They had 6,200 males¦62637 that were at least a¦62640 month¦62640 old,
\v 35 and¦62646 their leader¦62646 was¦62652 Avihayil's¦62655 son¦62653 Tsuriel¦62652. They¦62659 were to camp¦62659 on the northern¦62660 side¦62657 of¦62657 the¦62658 \add ≈sacred¦62658 tent¦62658\add*.
\v 36 \add *They¦62665\add* were¦62666 \add ≈in charge of\add* all the¦62666 frames¦62666 for the¦62667 \add ≈sacred¦62667 tent¦62667\add*, its crossbars¦62668, posts, bases¦62670, all¦62671 its¦62673 containers and¦62674 equipment¦62673,
\v 37 as well as the¦62677 pillars¦62677 \add used to make\add* the¦62678 courtyard¦62678 with their¦62680 bases¦62680, pegs¦62681, and¦62682 ropes¦62682.
\p
\v 38 Mosheh¦62694 and¦62696 Aharon¦62696 and¦62697 his¦62697 sons¦62697 \add ≈set¦62706 up their tents\add* \add ≈in¦62685 front¦62685 of¦62685\add* \add the entrance on\add* the¦62686 eastern¦62687 side of¦62688 the¦62689 \add ≈sacred tent¦62689\add*. They were \add ≈in charge of¦62689\add* that¦62698 tent¦62700 and \add ?≈the¦62701 needs of¦62701\add* the¦62702 \add ≈Israelis¦62703\add*. Any stranger¦62704 who approached¦62705 had to be¦62706 \add ≈executed¦62706\add*.
\v 39 Mosheh¦62714 and¦62715 Aharon¦62715 listed 22,000 Levite¦62711 males¦62724 that were at least a¦62727 month¦62727 old, listing them by their¦62721 clans¦62721 as \add ≈per Yahweh's¦62720 instructions\add*.
\s1 Paying the price for the firstborn sons
\rem /s1 The Redemption of the Firstborn; The Levites Take the Place of the First-Born Sons; Redeeming the Firstborn Sons
\p
\v 40 Then¦62734 Yahweh¦62735 told¦62734 Mosheh¦62738, “List all¦62740 the \add other\add* male¦62743 \add ≈Israeli¦62745\add* that are at least one month¦62748 old and \add ≈count¦62752 them\add*.
\v 41 The¦62758 Levites¦62758 are for me¦62759, Yahweh¦62761, in¦62762 the place¦62762 of¦62762 the firstborn males from every \add ≈Israeli¦62767\add* family, and¦62768 their animals¦62769 are in¦62771 place¦62771 of¦62771 the \add ≈Israelis¦62777'\add* firstborn male animals.”
