\v 14 and¦63144 put¦63144 all¦63148 the utensils¦63150 they¦63152 use on¦63153 top of it¦63153: the¦63157 trays¦63157, meat forks¦63160, \add #shovel¦63163\add* and¦63164 basins¦63166 for the¦63169 altar¦63169. Then¦63170 they¦63170 must¦63170 cover¦63172 it¦63171 with \add ?≈fine\add* leather, and¦63175 then put¦63175 its¦63176 poles¦63176 \add through the rings\add*.
