\p
\v 1 Then¦63762 Yahweh¦63763 told¦63762 Mosheh¦63766 \add !(Moses¦63766)\add*,
\v 2 “Order the¦63772 \add ≈Israelis¦63773\add* that¦63774 anyone¦63780 with a¦63780 skin¦63780 disease¦63780 or a¦63783 discharge¦63783, and¦63784 anyone who's ‘unclean¦63785’ because they touched a¦63786 corpse¦63786, must be sent¦63774 outside the¦63777 camp¦63777.
\v 3 Whether they're male¦63788 or female¦63791, they must¦63792 be sent¦63792 outside¦63795 the camp¦63796 so¦63798 that¦63803 the whole camp doesn't become ‘unclean¦63799’ \add because\add* I'm¦63804 living¦63805 there \add right\add* amongst¦63806 them¦63806.”
\v 4 ⇔\add ≈So the Israelis¦63828\add* did what Yahweh¦63821 told¦63820 Mosheh¦63824, and sent¦63813 those¦63814 people outside¦63817 the camp¦63818.
\s1 Reparations for crimes
