\v 17 Then¦67187 the¦67188 \add ≈sacred¦67188 tent¦67188\add* was disassembled, and¦67189 the¦67190 men of Gershon¦67192 and¦67193 Merari¦67194 set¦67189 off, carrying¦67195 the¦67196 tent¦67196.
