\v 21 Then¦67236 the \add ≈sacred utensils\add* were carried¦67238 out¦67236 by the Kohatite \add men\add*, who¦67238 \add ≈then¦67240 helped set¦67240 up¦67240 the¦67243 sacred¦67243 tent¦67243 when they¦67246 arrived¦67246\add*.
