\p
\v 1 Then¦69679 Yahweh¦69680 told¦69679 Mosheh¦69683 \add !(Moses¦69683)\add*,
\v 2 “Tell¦69686 the¦69689 \add ≈Israelis¦69690\add* that when¦69691 they \add ≈enter the¦69697 region¦69697 that¦69699 I'll¦69700 give¦69701 them to¦69702 live¦69698 in\add*, \add they must do this:\add*
\v 3 \add When\add* you¦69704 all make¦69704 a¦69705 gift to¦69706 Yahweh¦69706—a¦69707 burnt¦69707 offering¦69707 or¦69708 a¦69710 sacrifice¦69710, to¦69711 fulfill¦69711 a¦69713 vow¦69713, or¦69714 as a¦69715 freewill¦69715 offering¦69715, or¦69716 at¦69717 your¦69717 appointed¦69717 times, to make¦69718 a scent¦69719 of¦69719 pleasing¦69720 for¦69721 Yahweh¦69721 from¦69722 the¦69724 cattle or¦69725 from¦69726 the¦69728 flock¦69728—
\v 4 then¦69730 the \add ≈donor\add* must¦69730 present their offering¦69732 to¦69733 Yahweh¦69733, \add along with\add* a¦69734 grain¦69734 offering¦69734 of a kilogram of fine¦69735 flour¦69735 mixed¦69737 with¦69738 0.9 litres of¦69739 \add olive\add* oil¦69740.
\v 5 \add ≈Also¦69742\add* about a quarter¦69744 of a litre of wine¦69742 for¦69743 the¦69745 drink offering¦69746 \add must be offered\add* with¦69747 the¦69749 burnt¦69749 offering¦69749 and/or¦69750 with \add each\add* male lamb¦69752.
\v 6 For¦69756 a ram¦69756, there must¦69757 also be a¦69758 grain¦69758 offering¦69758 of two¦69760 kilograms of fine¦69759 flour¦69759 mixed with mixed with 1.2 litres of oil¦69763
\v 7 plus¦69767 1.2 litres of wine¦69767, all to be presented¦69771 as a pleasing¦69774 aroma¦69772 to¦69775 Yahweh¦69775.
\v 8 When¦69777 you¦69779 offer¦69779 a¦69780 young¦69780 bull as a¦69783 burnt¦69783 offering¦69783 or¦69784 as a¦69786 sacrifice¦69786 such as fulfilling¦69787 a¦69789 vow¦69789 or¦69790 as a peace¦69792 offering¦69792,
\v 9 the \add ≈donor\add* must¦69795 present a¦69801 grain¦69801 offering¦69801 of 3.5kg of fine¦69802 flour¦69802 mixed¦69805 with¦69806 two litres of oil¦69806,
\v 10 plus¦69810 a¦69815 drink offering¦69815 of¦69815 two litres of wine¦69810, all to be presented¦69811 as a pleasing¦69818 aroma¦69816 to¦69819 Yahweh¦69819.
\p
\v 11 That's what must¦69822 be¦69822 done¦69822 for¦69823 each bull¦69823 or¦69825 ram¦69826 or¦69828 \add #lamb¦69831\add* or¦69832 young goat.
\v 12 Whatever number¦69835 \add of animals\add* that¦69836 you¦69837 offer¦69837, \add ≈there must¦69839 be the appropriate\add* \add grain and wine offerings\add*.
\v 13 Every¦69843 \add ≈native-born¦69845\add* \add Israeli\add* must¦69846 do¦69846 that when presenting a gift, all to¦69852 be presented¦69852 as a¦69853 pleasing¦69856 aroma¦69854 to¦69857 Yahweh¦69857.
\p
\v 14 If a \add ≈foreigner is staying with¦69862 you¦69862 all\add* or¦69864 living¦69861 among¦69867 you¦69867 for \add multiple\add* generations¦69868, and¦69869 they make an offering¦69870 to¦69874 Yahweh¦69874 with a pleasing¦69873 aroma¦69871, then they must \add ≈follow the same instructions\add* as¦69875 all of you¦69876.
\v 15 \add Yes,\add* \add ≈the¦69880 same regulations¦69881 apply to¦69883 both you¦69883 and¦69884 the foreigners¦69884 living¦69885 among you¦69889 all\add*. \add ≈That will¦69891 always¦69887 apply—foreigners¦69890 in¦69892 front¦69892 of¦69892 Yahweh¦69893 must do the same\add* as all of you.
\v 16 One¦69896 \add set of\add* instructions¦69895 and¦69897 regulations for¦69900 \add both\add* you¦69900 and¦69901 the foreigner¦69901 that¦69902 lives¦69902 among you¦69903 all.
\p
\v 17 Then¦69906 Yahweh¦69907 told¦69906 Mosheh¦69910,
\v 18 “Tell¦69913 the¦69916 \add ≈Israelis¦69917 that\add* when¦69920 you¦69920 get to¦69921 the¦69923 land¦69923 that I'm¦69925 taking you¦69927 to¦69928,
\v 19 and¦69930 \add you all settle there and\add* start eating¦69931 \add ≈food¦69932 that you've grown there\add*, you¦69934 all must¦69934 \add ≈dedicate\add* a¦69935 \add special\add* contribution¦69935 to¦69936 Yahweh¦69936.
\v 20 You must present the¦69938 first¦69938 portion of¦69938 your¦69939 dough¦69939 and hold it up¦69941 \add just\add* like¦69943 a¦69943 presentation from the¦69944 threshing¦69944 floor¦69944.
\v 21 You all must do that \add each year\add* with your first¦69949 dough¦69950, even through \add future\add* generations¦69954.
\s1 Handling unintentional non-compliance
