\p
\v 22 “\add ≈However,\add* if you¦69958 \add ≈do something wrong\add* and¦69959 don't¦69959 follow¦69960 all¦69962 these¦69965 instructions¦69964 that¦69966 Yahweh¦69969 told¦69968 Mosheh¦69972,
