\v 25 \add That way\add* the¦70022 priest¦70022 will¦70021 make¦70021 atonement¦70021 for the¦70028 \add ≈Israeli¦70029 community¦70027\add* and¦70030 they'll be¦70030 forgiven¦70030 because¦70032 it was¦70034 a mistake and¦70036 they'd brought¦70037 their¦70040 gift as an offering¦70041 to¦70042 Yahweh¦70042 plus¦70043 their¦70043 sin¦70043 offering¦70043 because of their¦70048 mistake.
