\v 32 \add One day\add* when¦70149 the¦70150 \add ≈Israelis¦70150\add* were¦70149 in¦70153 the wilderness¦70153, they \add ≈noticed¦70154\add* a¦70155 man¦70155 gathering¦70156 firewood¦70157 on¦70158 the rest day¦70158,
