\v 35 and¦70190 Yahweh¦70191 told¦70190 Mosheh¦70194, “That man¦70197 must¦70196 definitely be¦70196 put¦70196 to¦70196 death¦70196—the¦70203 community¦70203 must¦70198 do it¦70199 outside¦70204 the camp¦70205 by throwing rocks at him.”
