\v 39 Then¦70258 when¦70261 you¦70261 see¦70261 a tassel¦70260, it'll¦70262 remind you¦70263 of Yahweh's¦70269 instructions¦70268, and¦70270 \add so\add* you'll¦70270 \add ≈follow¦70270\add* them¦70271 \add ≈rather than your¦70276 own¦70276 desires and¦70277 lusts that¦70279 lead you¦70281 all¦70266 into unfaithfulness\add*.
