\v 41 I¦70297 am¦70298 your god Yahweh¦70298—the one who¦70300 brought¦70301 you all out¦70301 of¦70303 Egypt (Heb. Mitsrayim) to¦70305 be¦70305 your god¦70307. I¦70308 am¦70309 Yahweh¦70309 your god.”
\c 16
\s1 Korah's rebellion
\rem /s1 Revolt of Korah, Dathan, and Abiram; Korah's Rebellion; Korah, Dathan and Abiram; The Rebellion of Korah, Dathan, and Abiram
\p
\v 1 \add ≈Now\add* Korah¦70314 (son¦70315 of¦70315 Yitshar¦70317, son¦70318 of¦70318 Kehat, son¦70321 of¦70321 Levi¦70323) \add along with\add* Datan¦70324 and¦70325 Aviram¦70325 (sons¦70326 of¦70326 Eliav¦70327) and¦70328 On¦70328 (son¦70329 of¦70329 Pelet¦70331)\x + \xo 16:1-35: \xt Jude 11.\x*
\v 2 \add ≈rebelled¦70335\add* against Mosheh¦70337 along with 250 \add ≈respected, Israeli¦70341\add* community¦70345 leaders¦70344.
