\p
\v 4 \add ≈When¦70379\add* Mosheh¦70380 heard¦70379 \add <that\add*, he¦70381 fell¦70381 \add ≈to his knees with his face¦70384 to the ground\add*
\v 5 and¦70386 \add ≈responded¦70395\add* to¦70387 Korah¦70389 and¦70390 his¦70394 \add ≈supporters\add*, “\add Tomorrow\add* morning¦70396 Yahweh will show who's sacred and¦70397 who belongs to him. \add ?≈Yahweh will¦70397 present his chosen leader\add*. make¦70397 known¦70397 who¦70401 is to¦70403 him¦70403 and¦70404 the¦70406 holy¦70406 one, and¦70407 he¦70407 will¦70407 present to¦70408 him¦70408, and¦70409 whom¦70410 he¦70411 chooses¦70411 he¦70414 will¦70414 present to¦70415 him¦70415.
\v 6 \add ≈So\add* Korah¦70423 and¦70424 \add ≈supporters\add*, bring¦70419 incense burners
\v 7 and¦70428 put¦70428 \add ≈burning¦70431 coals\add* and incense¦70434 in¦70429 them¦70429, and¦70432 bring them¦70433 to¦70435 \add ≈Yahweh's¦70436 presence¦70435\add* tomorrow¦70437. Then¦70438 the¦70439 man¦70439 that Yahweh¦70443 chooses¦70442 will¦70445 be¦70445 the¦70445 sacred¦70445 one. \add ≈It's¦70438 you¦70448 Levites who think you're\add* great.”
\p
\v 8 Then¦70452 Mosheh¦70453 told¦70452 Korah¦70456, “\add ≈You Levites\add*, please¦70459 listen¦70457.
\v 9 \add ^Isn't it enough\add* for¦70464 you¦70464 all that¦70465 Yisrael's¦70469 god¦70468 separated¦70467 you¦70470 from¦70471 the \add rest of\add* the Israeli community to¦70473 present you¦70474 to¦70475 him¦70475 to¦70476 serve¦70476 in Yahweh's¦70481 residence and¦70482 to¦70482 stand¦70482 in¦70483 front¦70483 of¦70483 the¦70484 gatherings to¦70485 minister¦70485 to them¦70485?
\v 10 \add @Yahweh¦70487\add* has¦70487 presented¦70487 you¦70488 and¦70489 your¦70493 brothers¦70493, the¦70494 \add other\add* \add ≈Levites\add* to approach¦70487 \add <him\add*. Are you all¦70491 wanting the priesthood¦70501 \add now\add* also¦70499?
\v 11 \add ≈So¦70503\add* it's¦70519 Yahweh¦70511 that you¦70504 and your¦70507 group¦70507 are¦70508 opposing, not \add really\add* Aharon¦70512 that¦70516 you're¦70517 all¦70505 grumbling¦70517 about¦70507.”
