\v 19 plus¦70649 Korah¦70651 had \add also\add* assembled the¦70656 entire community¦70656 \add ≈to¦70657 oppose\add* \add @Mosheh and Aharon\add* at the¦70659 entrance¦70659 to the¦70660 \add ≈sacred\add* tent¦70660. Then¦70662 Yahweh's¦70665 \add ≈brilliance\add* appeared¦70662 to¦70666 all¦70668 the¦70670 community¦70670
\v 20 and¦70673 Yahweh¦70674 warned Mosheh¦70677 and¦70678 Aharon¦70680,
\v 21 “Get away from¦70684 \add ≈all those people¦70685\add*, then I¦70687 can destroy¦70687 them¦70689 in an instant¦70690.”
\p
\v 22 \add ≈However,\add* \add @Mosheh¦70692 and¦70692 Aharon¦70692\add* fell¦70692 \add ≈to their knees with their faces¦70695 to the ground and¦70696 interceded\add*, “God¦70697, \add you are\add* the¦70698 god¦70698 \add ≈who gives life¦70699 to¦70700 everything¦70700\add*. Will¦70710 you¦70710 be¦70710 angry¦70710 at the entire community¦70709 \add because of\add* the sin¦70705 of one¦70704 man¦70704?”
