\p
\v 36 Then¦70934 Yahweh¦70935 told¦70934 Mosheh¦70938,
\v 37 “Tell¦70942 the¦70949 priest¦70949 Eleazar¦70945 (Aharon's¦70948 son¦70946) to \add ≈collect the¦70953 incense pans¦70953\add* from¦70954 \add ≈those who were burnt¦70955\add*, and¦70956 scatter¦70959 the \add ≈coals far away\add* because¦70962 they're¦70963 sacred¦70963.
