\v 47 \add ≈So¦71148\add* Aharon¦71149 took¦71148 it as¦71150 Mosheh¦71153 had¦71152 told¦71152 \add <him\add* and¦71154 ran¦71154 into¦71155 the¦71157 middle¦71157 of¦71157 the¦71159 \add ≈people\add*. Wow¦71160, the¦71162 \add ≈deadly disease¦71162\add* had¦71161 already begun¦71161, \add ≈so¦71164 he¦71164 burnt\add* incense¦71167 and¦71168 made¦71168 atonement¦71168 for \add *them\add*.
