\v 49 There were¦71184 14,700 \add >people\add* who¦71185 died¦71185 from the \add ≈deadly disease¦71186\add*, in addition¦71192 to those¦71193 who'd¦71193 died¦71193 due to Korah's¦71198 \add ≈rebellion\add*.
