\v 4 Put them¦71271 \add all\add* in¦71272 the¦71272 \add ≈sacred\add* tent¦71272 in¦71274 front¦71274 of¦71274 the¦71275 \add ≈sacred box\add* where¦71276 I¦71277 meet¦71277 with you¦71278,
\v 5 and¦71282 then the staff¦71288 of the¦71283 man¦71283 that¦71297 I¦71285 choose¦71285 \add to be the priest\add* will¦71289 sprout. Then¦71290 the \add ≈people¦71295\add* can stop¦71290 complaining to¦71290 me¦71291 about you¦71300.”
