\v 12 Then¦71423 the¦71424 \add ≈Israelis¦71425\add* \add ≈complained\add* to¦71426 Mosheh¦71428, “Wow, \add ≈we're¦71431 done for—it's clear that we're¦71432 all¦71433 going to die¦71434\add*!
