\v 4 Then¦71522 must¦71522 \add ≈work¦71531 closely with\add* you¦71523 and¦71524 \add ≈take care\add* of¦71528 \add ≈all¦71530 the duties¦71527 to do with\add* the¦71532 \add ≈sacred\add* tent¦71532, \add ≈but¦71533\add* no \add ≈outsider¦71533\add* \add ≈is allowed to¦71537 approach¦71536\add*.
