\v 8 Then¦71602 Yahweh¦71603 told¦71602 Aharon¦71606, “\add ≈Also¦71607 listen\add*, I've put you in charge¦71613 of¦71613 \add ≈looking after\add* the¦71617 sacred¦71617 offerings¦71614 \add ≈to¦71621 me\add*. I've¦71623 given¦71623 them¦71623 to¦71624 you and¦71625 your sons¦71625 as your¦71625 \add ≈permanent¦71628 income\add*.
\v 9 Every offering apart from the burnt¦71638 offerings¦71641, will belong¦71632 to¦71642 you. That¦71651 includes their¦71644 grain¦71644 offerings¦71647, their¦71647 sin¦71647 offerings, and¦71648 their¦71650 guilt¦71650 offerings. \add ≈Once they're given, they¦71652 become sacred,\add* and they're for you and your¦71658 sons¦71658.
