\v 11 “\add ≈In addition¦71673,\add* the¦71676 \add people's\add* raised offerings¦71676 belong¦71675 to¦71675 you¦71675, and they are \add ≈permanently given¦71684 to your entire families¦71694\add* to eat—everyone¦71691 who's ‘clean¦71693’ may eat¦71695 them.
