\v 12 “All¦71698 the¦71699 best¦71699 of¦71699 the¦71700 fresh¦71700 oil¦71700, and¦71701 the¦71704 new¦71704 wine¦71704 and¦71705 grain¦71705 that¦71707 they¦71709 give¦71709 to¦71710 Yahweh¦71710, I¦71712 give¦71712 to you.
