\v 14 “Everything¦71731 throughout Yisrael¦71734 that's dedicated \add to Yahweh\add* will¦71736 belong¦71736 to you.\x + \xo 18:14: \xt Lev 27:28.\x*
\p
\v 15 “Every¦71738 firstborn¦71740 \add male\add* \add ≈baby\add*, as well as animals¦71750, will¦71751 belong¦71751 to¦71753 Yahweh¦71748, \add however\add* you¦71757 must¦71757 \add ≈buy back\add* the \add ≈human¦71760 babies\add* as well as the¦71762 firstborns¦71762 from the ‘unclean¦71765’ livestock.
