\v 17 \add ≈However,\add* the¦71784 firstborn¦71784 \add #cows¦71786\add* or¦71787 sheep¦71790 or¦71791 \add #goats¦71794\add* can't¦71795 be¦71797 \add ≈bought back\add*. They¦71798 are sacred¦71797—you¦71802 must¦71802 sprinkle¦71802 their¦71801 blood¦71801 on¦71803 the¦71805 altar¦71805 and¦71806 burn¦71809 their¦71808 fat¦71808 as an offering¦71810 that's a soothing¦71812 aroma¦71811 for¦71813 Yahweh¦71813.
\v 18 Their¦71815 meat¦71815 will¦71816 belong¦71816 to¦71818 you¦71818, just like¦71819 the¦71819 breast¦71819 or the right¦71822 thigh¦71821 of¦71821 the¦71822 wave offerings¦71820 are yours.
