\v 18 Then a¦72418 man¦72438 who's ‘clean¦72419’ must dip¦72416 some hyssop¦72415 in¦72417 that water¦72417 and¦72420 sprinkle¦72420 it onto the¦72423 tent¦72423 and¦72424 all¦72426 the¦72428 containers¦72428 \add in it\add* and¦72429 everyone¦72431 who¦72432 lives in it or who¦72438 touched¦72438 the¦72441 body¦72443 or¦72442 the¦72443 bone¦72439 or¦72444 grave¦72445.
