\v 28 \add ≈So¦74854\add* Balak¦74855 took¦74854 \add *him¦74858\add* to the¦74859 top¦74859 of¦74859 \add Mt.\add* Peor¦74860 \add ≈that¦74861 faces¦74864 down¦74861\add* to the¦74865 wilderness,
\v 29 and¦74867 \add again\add* Bileam¦74868 told¦74867 \add *him¦74871\add*, “Build¦74872 seven¦74876 altars¦74877 and¦74878 prepare¦74878 seven¦74881 bulls¦74882 and¦74883 seven¦74883 rams¦74884 for me \add ≈here\add*.”
\v 30 \add ≈So¦74886\add* Balak¦74887 \add ≈followed those instructions\add* and¦74891 offered a¦74892 bull¦74892 and¦74893 a¦74893 ram¦74893 on¦74894 \add each\add* altar¦74894.
\c 24
