\q1
\v 5 \add ≈Yes\add* Yakov¦74965, your¦74964 tents¦74964 look good¦74963.
\q1 ≈\add ≈Yes\add* Yisrael¦74967, \add ≈the places¦74966 where you're living¦74966\add*:
\q1
\v 6 They¦74970 stretch¦74970 out¦74970 like a riverbed.
