\q1 Like¦74974 \add ≈palms\add* that¦74975 Yahweh¦74976 has¦74975 planted¦74975,
\q1 ≈Like¦74977 cedar¦74977 \add trees\add* beside the waters¦74980.
\q1
\v 7 Water¦74984 will \add ≈spill over the top of\add* his buckets¦74985,
\q1 and¦74986 his \add ≈descendants¦74986 will¦74987 flow¦74982 out\add* like water¦74987.
\q1 \add @Yisrael's¦74989\add* king¦74991 will¦74989 be¦74989 greater than¦74990 \add King\add* Agag¦74990,
\q1 and his kingdom¦74993 will¦74992 become honoured¦74992.
\q1
\v 8 God¦74995 is¦74996 bringing¦74996 him \add here\add* from¦74997 Egypt¦74997
\q1 \add with power\add* like¦74998 the¦74998 horns¦74998 of¦74998 a¦74999 wild¦74999 bull¦74999.
\q1 He'll \add ≈devastate\add* those nations¦75002 \add ≈that oppose him\add*.
\q1 He'll break¦75005 their¦75004 bones¦75004, and¦75006 his arrows¦75006 will¦75007 pierce them¦75007.
\q1
\v 9 He crouched¦75009—lying¦75010 down¦75010 like¦75011 a¦75011 lion¦75011 or a¦75012 lioness.
\q1 Who¦75013 will¦75014 rouse¦75014 him?
\q1 Those¦75015 who¦75015 bless¦75015, you¦75015 will be¦75016 blessed¦75016,
\q1 ^\add ≈but¦75017\add* those¦75017 who¦75017 curse¦75017 you¦75017, will be¦75018 cursed¦75018.\x + \xo 24:9: a \xt Gen 49:9; \xo b \xt Gen 12:3.\x*
\p
\v 10 Then¦75020 \add King\add* Balak¦75023 \add ≈got very angry¦75022\add* with Bileam¦75026, and¦75027 he¦75027 banged his¦75030 hands¦75030 together and¦75031 said¦75031 \add angrily\add*, “I¦75038 called¦75038 you to¦75036 \em curse¦75036\em* my¦75037 enemies¦75037, and¦75039 \add ≈blast you¦75040\add*, you've actually¦75041 blessed¦75041 \add <them\add* three¦75043 times¦75044 \add now\add*!
\v 11 \add ≈Now¦75046 get back to where you came from\add*! I¦75053 said¦75053 that I'd¦75055 honour¦75055 you¦75055 \add ≈very well\add*, but¦75056 man, Yahweh¦75058 has¦75057 kept you¦75057 from¦75059 any honour¦75059!”
\p
\v 12 \add ≈But¦75061\add* Bileam¦75062 \add ≈replied¦75061\add*, “Didn't¦75066 I also¦75067 tell the messengers¦75070 that you¦75073 sent¦75073 to¦75074 me¦75074 that
\v 13 even if¦75078 \add *you\add* gave¦75080 me¦75082 a house¦75085 full of¦75085 gold¦75087 and silver¦75086, I¦75089 wouldn't be¦75089 able¦75089 \add ≈to¦75090 say anything other than what Yahweh¦75094 tells me\add*—whether good¦75096 or¦75097 evil? Whatever Yahweh¦75103 tells me, that's¦75100 what I¦75105 have to say¦75105.
