\v 14 \add ≈So¦75107 yes,\add* I'll¦75108 go¦75109 back home now¦75107, \add ≈but first, allow me\add* to¦75110 tell you¦75112 what that¦75113 people group will¦75114 do¦75114 to¦75117 your¦75117 people in¦75118 the¦75119 future.”
