\v 25 Then¦75249 Bileam¦75250 \add ≈packed up¦75249\add* and¦75251 went¦75251 home¦75253, and¦75254 \add King\add* Balak¦75256 also¦75254 went¦75257 on his¦75258 way¦75258.
\c 25
