\v 1 \add ≈Meanwhile,\add* \add ≈the Israelis¦75262 settled down¦75261\add* at Shittim¦75263, and¦75264 \add ≈their men¦75265 started¦75264 sleeping with women¦75269 from Moav¦75270\add*
\v 2 \add ≈who then¦75272\add* invited¦75272 them to sacrifices¦75274 to their¦75275 \add ≈idols\add*. \add ≈So\add* \add @the¦75278 Israelis¦75278\add* bowed¦75278 down¦75278 \add to the idols\add* and ate¦75276 \add at the feasts\add*,
\v 3 and¦75282 \add when\add* Yisrael¦75283 consecrated themselves to¦75284 Baal¦75284-Peor¦75285, Yahweh's¦75289 anger¦75288 burnt¦75286 towards \add *them¦75290\add*.
\v 4 Then¦75292 Yahweh¦75293 told¦75292 Mosheh¦75296, “\add ≈Execute\add* all¦75300 the¦75303 people's¦75303 leaders¦75302 and \add ≈display their bodies in broad daylight\add*, and then Yahweh's¦75306 \add ≈anger¦75311\add* might¦75309 turn¦75309 back away¦75309 from¦75314 Yisrael¦75314.”
