\v 5 \add ≈So¦75316\add* Mosheh¦75317 to¦75318 Yisrael's¦75321 judges¦75320, “\add ≈Each of¦75320 you must execute¦75322 your men¦75324 who¦75325 have¦75325 joined¦75325 others to¦75326 serve\add* Baal¦75326-Peor¦75327.”
