\v 14 The¦75473 \add ≈Israeli¦75474\add* man¦75473 \add ≈who was killed\add* with¦75478 the¦75480 Midyanite¦75480 woman was¦75481 Salu's¦75484 son¦75482 Zimri¦75481, a¦75485 \add ≈clan leader¦75485\add* from the Shimeon tribe.
\v 15 The¦75492 Midyanite woman¦75492 \add ≈who¦75493 was¦75493 killed¦75493\add* was¦75495 Kozbi, the¦75496 daughter¦75496 of¦75496 Tsur¦75498, a¦75499 Midyanite clan¦75500 leader¦75499.
