\v 17 “\add ≈Attack¦75519\add* the¦75518 Midyanites¦75518 and¦75519 \add ≈destroy\add* them¦75520
\v 18 because¦75522 they¦75524 were \add ≈treacherously deceiving¦75526\add* you¦75530 all over the¦75533 matter¦75533 of¦75533 Peor¦75535 and¦75536 Kozbi, the¦75540 daughter¦75540 of¦75540 one of¦75542 \add *their¦75543\add* \add #leaders¦75542\add* who¦75545 was¦75545 killed¦75545 on¦75546 the¦75546 day¦75546 of¦75546 the¦75548 \add ≈deadly disease¦75548\add* at \add Mt.\add* Peor¦75553.”
