\v 10 Then¦75690 the¦75691 earth¦75691 \add ≈split open¦75690\add* and¦75695 swallowed¦75695 them¦75696 and¦75697 Korah¦75699. Yahweh had also sent a fire¦75703 that consumed¦75702 250 men¦75707, and¦75708 they¦75708 became a¦75709 warning¦75709 sign¦75709.
\v 11 \add ≈However,\add* Korah's¦75713 descendants¦75711 hadn't died¦75716 \add then\add*.)
