\v 21 \add ≈When¦76722\add* \add he needs guidance\add*, he¦76725 must¦76725 stand¦76725 \add ≈in¦76722 front¦76722\add* of¦76722 the¦76724 priest¦76724 Eleazar¦76723 and¦76726 ask¦76726 for Yahweh's¦76731 decision¦76728 \add to be given via\add* the¦76729 Urim¦76729. Then¦76736 \add @Yehoshua\add* and¦76741 all¦76741 the¦76743 \add ≈people¦76743\add* will go¦76735 in or come¦76739 out¦76735 as per \add @Yahweh's¦76746\add* \add ≈instructions\add*.”\x + \xo 27:21: \xt Exo 28:30; 1Sam 14:41; 28:6.\x*
