\v 2 “Tell¦80172 the¦80170 \add ≈people¦80170\add* that you're all about¦80177 to¦80177 enter Canaan¦80181—the¦80183 land¦80183 that¦80184 will¦80185 become your inheritance¦80187. \add ≈The¦80188 boundaries¦80190 will be\add*:
