\v 3 “The \bd southern¦80196\bd* border will extend from¦80197 the¦80197 Tsin¦80199 wilderness¦80197 along the¦80202 Edom¦80203 border across to the Salt¦80211 \add !(Dead¦80211)\add* Sea¦80209 on the¦80211 east¦80212,
