\v 5 From¦80237 Atsmon¦80237 \add it will extend west\add* to the¦80238 riverbed¦80238 at the¦80236 border¦80236 with Egypt¦80239, and¦80240 then across to¦80242 the¦80242 \add Mediterranean\add* Sea¦80242.
