\p “Those will¦80330 be¦80330 your \add ≈country's¦80332\add* borders¦80333.”
\p
\v 13 Then¦80336 Mosheh¦80337 \add ≈continued\add*, “That¦80343 will be the¦80344 land¦80344 that¦80345 \add must be distributed\add* by¦80348 lot¦80348. It'll be given¦80352 by Yahweh¦80351 as an \add ≈inheritance¦80346\add* for the¦80353 nine¦80353 tribes¦80354 and¦80355 the Menashsheh half-tribe\x + \xo 34:13: \xt Num 26:52-56.\x*
\v 14 \add as\add* the Reuven and¦80365 Gad tribes¦80365 and¦80371 the Menashsheh¦80373 half-tribe have¦80374 already received their¦80375 inheritance¦80375.
