\v 29 \add ≈The above\add* are¦80523 \add the men\add* that Yahweh¦80525 \add ≈put in¦80532 charge of¦80533 dividing up\add* Kanaan¦80533 as¦80526 the inheritance¦80526 for the¦80529 \add ≈Israelis¦80531\add*.
\c 35
\s1 Cities for the Levites
